  (text "Every module pin is brought out 1:1 to the header beside it. J4 counts" (at 20.0 151.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ebe84a3f-46be-5e94-9b18-8da4ede08ff9"))
  (text "down against the module: the Pico numbers its right hand side from the" (at 20.0 156.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b094c533-e6d4-571d-aedd-5250cf5b2474"))
  (text "bottom and a pin header numbers itself from the top." (at 20.0 161.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "500a50bf-6e9c-5cba-b705-b72c9abf37d8"))
  (text "5 V reaches VSYS through D1, which is what the Pico datasheet asks for" (at 20.0 166.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cbeeac62-62f9-51fc-9b3c-fe72cb3470e4"))
  (text "- it stops USB and the external supply fighting when both are plugged" (at 20.0 171.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e0d3ab5c-9578-5aab-a005-d28dadb392b5"))
  (text "in, at the cost of a diode drop. C1 22 uF / 16 V is the bulk that goes" (at 20.0 176.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9b4faca1-e3c4-563a-94ad-543867ee57ee"))
  (text "with it, small enough to sit against the pin, which an electrolytic is" (at 20.0 181.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "664e581d-d483-5d78-92f1-e0cd239faea8"))
  (text "not. C2 bypasses the module's own 3.3 V and D3 says that rail is up." (at 20.0 186.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8f6a9ee2-6aa5-52f6-8bca-67900026fec6"))
  (text "AGND goes to the header on its own: the module already joins it to GND," (at 20.0 191.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "70016d6a-60f3-5c06-b351-53d702f2b7e4"))
  (text "and doing it again here is two power outputs wired together." (at 20.0 196.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "788b0771-6575-5877-a4e1-6154e857f14e"))
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
